'''The Witch of Northwind''' is a [[human]] alchemy trainer and quest giver located at the [[Witch Coven]] in [[Northwind]]. She is the head of a coven of which [[Mayor Birkton|Lydia Birkton]] was once a part of, before she left to become mayor of [[Ambershire]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|34|Deathcap And Widow's Frill}}</ref>

